<title>USA: Weirton Steel ups sheet prices $10/ton.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel ups sheet prices $10/ton.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W. Va. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weirton Steel Corp said Tuesday it is increasing prices on all steel sheet products by $10 per ton, effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Base prices on coated and noncoated products will remain unchanged, but the company said it will reduce competitive discounts on sheet transactions with customers.</p>
</text>
